---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<section class="waitlist-section section" id="waitlist" aria-labelledby="waitlist-title">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">Folk Lore · Early access</p><h2 id="waitlist-title">Interested in live team memory?</h2><p>Git-based sharing through <code>.lore.md</code> works today. Folk Lore is the upcoming hosted layer for continuous team sync.</p><a class="text-link icon-link" href={`${base}docs/team-memory/`}><span class="link-label">How team sharing works</span> <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
  <div class="signup">
    <p id="waitlist-description">Join the list for email updates about team early access. Signing up does not create an account or grant access.</p>
    <div id="waitlist-form-view" class="cta-form-view show">
      <form id="waitlist-form" action="https://app.loops.so/api/newsletter-form/cmpemslgp03m10jxaipjw78iq" method="POST" aria-describedby="waitlist-description">
        <label for="waitlist-email">Email address</label>
        <input id="waitlist-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required />
        <div id="waitlist-error" class="cta-form-view signup-error" role="alert" tabindex="-1"><p id="waitlist-error-msg">We couldn’t add your email. Try again.</p></div>
        <button class="button button-primary" type="submit" id="waitlist-btn">Join early access list</button>
      </form>
      <p class="muted small">Unsubscribe using the link in any update.</p>
    </div>
    <div id="waitlist-success" class="cta-form-view receipt" role="status" tabindex="-1"><h3>You’re on the list.</h3><p>We’ll email you about Folk Lore early access. This does not create an account or enable team sync.</p><a href={`${base}docs/install/`} class="icon-link"><span class="link-label">Use local Lore while you wait</span> <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
  </div>
</section>
